This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses the Google C++ Style Guide as a grounded IDD graph so consuming
projects can compose it with throughline-compose.

The Google C++ Style Guide is published by Google under the Creative Commons
Attribution 3.0 License. The rule text re-expressed here in items' `text`/`attrs.source_ref`
is derived from that guide and remains the work of Google and its contributors; this
repository claims no ownership over that content and reproduces it for interoperability.
See https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html for the authoritative source.
